            <p><span class="figure-number">Figure 4: </span>Intervals for which Emacs is blocked when previewing using SVG and PNG images.  The vertical axis is time, and the solid chunks are periods where Emacs is unresponsive.</p>
        </figcaption>
</figure>

<p>They differ even between different versions of the same program across Texlive versions:</p>
<p><a id="figure--org-latex-preview-texlive-2022-vs-2023"></a></p>
<figure><img src="https://karthinks.com/img/texlive2022-vs-texlive2023.svg"
