<a href="https://karthinks.com/img/olp-prog-preview.mp4">[Video demo: LaTeX previews in prog-mode]</a></video>
<p>In fact, you can use the same code to preview LaTeX fragments literally anywhere in Emacs, including, delightfully, the Emacs calculator.  This (18 minute) demo runs through a bunch of contexts outside of Org mode showcasing live LaTeX previews:</p>
